  "text": "<h2 id=\"Early_life\">Early life</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Competitive_skating_career\">Competitive skating career</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Novice_and_junior_career_(2004–2010)\"><span id=\"Novice_and_junior_career_.282004.E2.80.932010.29\"></span>Novice and junior career (2004–2010)</h3>\n<h3 id=\"First_Olympic_cycle_(2010–2014)\"><span id=\"First_Olympic_cycle_.282010.E2.80.932014.29\"></span>First Olympic cycle (2010–2014)</h3>\n<h4 id=\"2010–11_season:_International_senior_debut\"><span id=\"2010.E2.80.9311_season:_International_senior_debut\"></span>2010–11 season: International senior debut</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2011–12_season:_First_world_medal\"><span id=\"2011.E2.80.9312_season:_First_world_medal\"></span>2011–12 season: First world medal</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2012–13_season:_First_national_senior_title\"><span id=\"2012.E2.80.9313_season:_First_national_senior_title\"></span>2012–13 season: First national senior title</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2013–14_season:_First_Olympic_and_world_title\"><span id=\"2013.E2.80.9314_season:_First_Olympic_and_world_title\"></span>2013–14 season: First Olympic and world title</h4>\n<h3 id=\"Second_Olympic_cycle_(2014–2018)\"><span id=\"Second_Olympic_cycle_.282014.E2.80.932018.29\"></span>Second Olympic cycle (2014–2018)</h3>\n<h4 id=\"2014–15_season:_Second_Grand_Prix_Final_win\"><span id=\"2014.E2.80.9315_season:_Second_Grand_Prix_Final_win\"></span>2014–15 season: Second Grand Prix Final win</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2015–16_season:_Back-to-back_world_records\"><span id=\"2015.E2.80.9316_season:_Back-to-back_world_records\"></span>2015–16 season: Back-to-back world records</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2016–17_season:_Second_world_title\"><span id=\"2016.E2.80.9317_season:_Second_world_title\"></span>2016–17 season: Second world title</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2017–18_season:_Second_Olympic_title\"><span id=\"2017.E2.80.9318_season:_Second_Olympic_title\"></span>2017–18 season: Second Olympic title</h4>\n<h3 id=\"Third_Olympic_cycle_(2018–2022)\"><span id=\"Third_Olympic_cycle_.282018.E2.80.932022.29\"></span>Third Olympic cycle (2018–2022)</h3>\n<h4 id=\"2018–19_season:_Records_in_new_judging_system\"><span id=\"2018.E2.80.9319_season:_Records_in_new_judging_system\"></span>2018–19 season: Records in new judging system</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2019–20_season:_Achieving_Super_Slam\"><span id=\"2019.E2.80.9320_season:_Achieving_Super_Slam\"></span>2019–20 season: Achieving Super Slam</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2020–21_season:_Seventh_world_medal\"><span id=\"2020.E2.80.9321_season:_Seventh_world_medal\"></span>2020–21 season: Seventh world medal</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2021–22_season:_Sixth_national_title_and_third_Olympics\"><span id=\"2021.E2.80.9322_season:_Sixth_national_title_and_third_Olympics\"></span>2021–22 season: Sixth national title and third Olympics</h4>\n<h2 id=\"Professional_skating_career\">Professional skating career</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Launch_of_social_media_and_Share_Practice\">Launch of social media and <i>Share Practice</i></h3>\n<div class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" role=\"note\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Yuzuru_Hanyu_Olympic_seasons#Olympic_program_challenges\" title=\"Yuzuru Hanyu Olympic seasons\">Yuzuru Hanyu Olympic seasons § Olympic program challenges</a></div>\n<h3 id=\"Yuzuru_Hanyu_Ice_Story_solo_show_series\">Yuzuru Hanyu Ice Story solo show series</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Yuzuru_Hanyu_Notte_Stellata_and_other_charity_shows\">Yuzuru Hanyu Notte Stellata and other charity shows</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Skating_technique_and_style\">Skating technique and style</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Public_life\">Public life</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Endorsements_and_ambassadorships\">Endorsements and ambassadorships</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Philanthropy\">Philanthropy</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Film_and_television\">Film and television</h3>\n<div class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" role=\"note\">For more details about Hanyu's DVD and Blu-ray releases, see <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_figure_skating_programs_of_Yuzuru_Hanyu#Home_media\" title=\"List of figure skating programs of Yuzuru Hanyu\">List of figure skating programs of Yuzuru Hanyu § Home media</a>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Books_and_magazines\">Books and magazines</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Accolades_and_impact\">Accolades and impact</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Personal_life_and_education\">Personal life and education</h2>\n<h2 id=\"World_records_and_other_achievements\">World records and other achievements</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Programs_and_ice_show_productions\">Programs and ice show productions</h2>\n<div class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" role=\"note\">For the detailed list of Hanyu's programs and choreographers, see <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_figure_skating_programs_of_Yuzuru_Hanyu\" title=\"List of figure skating programs of Yuzuru Hanyu\">List of figure skating programs of Yuzuru Hanyu</a>.</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<caption style=\"line-height:1.2; padding-bottom:0.2em;\">Shortlist of senior competition programs by season <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NCF220722_37-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NCF220722-37\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>36<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr style=\"height:2.1em; line-height:0.9;\">\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:4em;\">Season\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Short_program_(figure_skating)\" title=\"Short program (figure skating)\">Short program</a>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Free_skating\" title=\"Free skating\">Free skate program</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:2.1em; line-height:1.2em;\">\n<th rowspan=\"\" scope=\"row\" style=\"padding-left:0; padding-right:0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/2010%E2%80%9311_figure_skating_season\" title=\"2010–11 figure skating season\"> 2010–11</a>\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"\">\"White Legend\"\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Zigeunerweisen\" title=\"Zigeunerweisen\">Zigeunerweisen</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:2.1em; line-height:1.