_Seimei\" title=\"Abe no Seimei\">Seimei</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:2.1em; line-height:1.2em;\">\n<th rowspan=\"\" scope=\"row\" style=\"line-height:1.3em; padding-left:0; padding-right:0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/2016%E2%80%9317_figure_skating_season\" title=\"2016–17 figure skating season\"> 2016–17</a>\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"\">\"<a href=\"/wiki/Let%27s_Go_Crazy\" title=\"Let's Go Crazy\">Let's Go Crazy</a>\"\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"\"><i>Hope and Legacy</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:2.1em; line-height:1.2em; background-color:#eaf3ff;\">\n<th rowspan=\"\" scope=\"row\" style=\"line-height:1.3em; padding-left:0; padding-right:0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/2017%E2%80%9318_figure_skating_season\" title=\"2017–18 figure skating season\"> 2017–18</a><br/><span class=\"mw-valign-baseline\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Olympic season\"><img alt=\"Olympic season\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-height=\"158\" data-file-width=\"342\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"14\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Olympic_rings_without_rims.svg/40px-Olympic_rings_without_rims.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Olympic_rings_without_rims.svg/60px-Olympic_rings_without_rims.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"30\"/></span></span>\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"\"><div style=\"padding-top:0.2em; padding-bottom:0.2em;\">\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;\"><b>Ballade No. 1 in G minor</b></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:85%;\">\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;\"><div style=\"padding-top:0.5em;\">(<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Ballade_No._1_(figure_skating_program)\" title=\"Ballade No. 1 (figure skating program)\">Background and making</a>)</div>\n</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"\"><div style=\"padding-top:0.2em; padding-bottom:0.2em;\">\n<div style=\"line-height:1.2;\"